.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH NICE 1 "2026-09-01"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
nice \- Run COMMAND with an adjusted niceness, which affects process scheduling.
With no COMMAND, print the current niceness.  Niceness values range from
\-20 (most favorable to the process) to 19 (least favorable to the process).
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBnice\fR [OPTION] [COMMAND [ARG]...]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Run COMMAND with an adjusted niceness, which affects process scheduling.
With no COMMAND, print the current niceness.  Niceness values range from
\-20 (most favorable to the process) to 19 (least favorable to the process).
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-adjustment\fR
add N to the niceness (default is 10)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
\fB\-V\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
Print version
.TP
[\fICOMMAND\fR]

.SH "نسخه (VERSION)"
v(uutils coreutils) 0.11.0
